hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"246.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr from A'isha"
"246.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr from A'isha"
"247.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"247.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"248","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari said"
"249","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Yusuf that as- Sa'ib ibn Yazid said"
"250","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yazid ibn Ruman said"
"251","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that he heard al-Araj say"
"252","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr said"
"253","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that Dhakwan Abu Amr (a slave belonging to A'isha"
